; Which command frames of WHO 16 and WHO 25 leave a gateway: WHO 16 on WHERE 31 and on WHERE
; 101 (*16*WHAT*31##, *16*WHAT*101##), WHO 25 with the plain WHAT and with the WHAT#1 form on
; WHERE 21 (*25*WHAT*21##, *25*WHAT#1*21##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same values in
; all four series, WHAT 0..36, 40, 50, 99, 100, 255, 1000, 9999.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

